.env
*.log
# Generated payload directories. ANCHORED, deliberately — an unanchored
# `data/` matches a directory called `data` at ANY depth, which inside
# `mjolnir/base/` (35k decompiled APK files) hits 23 tracked smali files in
# Java packages named `data`, e.g.
# `com/google/android/gms/common/data/DataBuffer.smali`. They are tracked, so
# nothing is lost today, but re-extracting the APK base — the input to the one
# irreversible build (D04) — would silently drop them. Anchor every pattern
# that could reach into `mjolnir/base/`.
/mjolnir/data/
/phonexa/data/
# git-backup: a separate git repository (its own remote, its own commits),
# nested here only because that's where the operator cloned it — never
# part of tun's own history.
tun-backup/
